{
  "slug": "story",
  "name": "Story",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Cross-session context persistence for AI coding projects. Tracks tickets, issues, roadmap, and handovers in a .story/ directory so every session builds on the last instead of starting from zero. Includes 30 MCP tools, autonomous mode, and AI-assisted project setup.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 hook** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `go` (Track tickets, issues, and progress for your project)\n- **Hooks** (1): `PreCompact`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `claudestory`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install story@claude-community` from `AmirShayegh/ClaudeStory`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
